Two neighbouring chapters of the recording.

Chapter A (0:00 – 10:00):
Title: Отчёт
Summary: Сроки.
Decisions: Сдать в пятницу
Topics: сроки; отчёт

Chapter B (10:00 – 20:00):
Title: Бюджет
Summary: Цифры.
Actions: Михаил проверит
Questions: Когда созвон?

Is chapter B the same subject as chapter A, continued? Answer true when B goes on with the same question, object or story as A — told in other words, with more detail, or after a short aside. Answer false when B turns to something a reader would look for as its own chapter, even if it is related to A or the speakers are the same.

Write a JSON object:
same — true or false, as above.
